flowchart TB
  R[Researcher] --> C[Research Contract\nMarkdown: purpose • scope • authorization • acceptance]
  C --> E[Experiment Requirements\nYAML: workload • OS • isolation • network • instrumentation]
  E --> A[Primary Agent / Goose\nplan • select • delegate • observe]
  A --> OP[Operator Command Surface\nGoose recipe + Cusimanse CLI + adapter handoff]
  OP -->|validate| VAL[Validation / Preflight]
  VAL -->|ready| RES[Go Capability API\nresolve • provision • configure • execute • collect • destroy]
  RES --> REG[Capability Registry\nversioned profiles]
  REG --> HP[Host Profile\nLinux + Lima/QEMU capabilities]
  REG --> WP[Workload Profile\nfixed handler + fixture]
  RES -->|policy gate| PC[Declarative Policy\npolicies/host-policy.yaml\npolicyctl compatibility enforcement]
  PC -->|allow / approved| RES
  PC -->|deny| STOP[STOP]
  RES --> VM[Lima / QEMU Disposable VM\nexecution + isolation boundary]
  HP --> RES
  WP --> RES
  RES --> INST[Declared Instrumentation\nprocess • syscall • filesystem • network]
  INST --> VM
  VM --> WORK[Workload Handler\nGo • npm • controlled fixtures]
  WORK --> EV[Evidence Bundle\nraw observations + audit events]
  EV --> HASH[Session / Provenance\nSHA-256 + manifest]
  HASH --> ANALYZE[Specialist Roles + Skills\nruntime • forensics • detection]
  ANALYZE --> VERIFY[Independent Verifier]
  VERIFY --> REPORT[Report Generator\nresearch-report/report.md + .yaml]
  REPORT --> PRESERVE[Preserve artifacts]
  PRESERVE --> DESTROY[Destroy VM]
  DESTROY --> OBS[Observability / audit correlation]
  OBS --> A
  EXT[Pluggable Providers\nLima • future QEMU/WSL2/container] -.-> RES
  AD[Agent Adapters\nGoose native • OpenCode • Hermes • Antigravity • Pi] -.-> OP
  SK[Skills / MCP / Gateways / Phoenix / OTel / Numbat / Aegis / ClawMetry] -.-> A
